{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:28d6eb32d25b79b0","name":"Provocateur Talent Tree","source":{"id":"source:reference-28d6eb32d25b79b0","title":"Provocateur Talent Tree","revision":20278,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T23:33:09Z","sha256":"67d78df4f0e299c8658350acd86f55d907fdc8e9b615c25ce798a299d1ac6d84","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20278","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Provocateur%20Talent%20Tree&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-28d6eb32d25b79b0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Legacy Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Legacy_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a provocateur, you specialize in turning your enemies against one another, giving your allies the advantage. This is accomplished through a combination of gaining an enemy's confidence, making careful use of deception, and coordinating your allies' attacks.\n"]},"\n\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Core Talents"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Cast Suspicion"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Swift Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Swift_Action"},", you can select one enemy within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". That enemy loses all morale and insight bonuses on attack rolls and cannot be aided (using the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action) by its allies until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Distress to Discord"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["You encourage your allies to sow discord among your enemies by fighting with renewed vigor. Whenever an ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," takes its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"},", all enemies within 2 squares of that ally lose their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Dexterity"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dexterity"}," bonuses to their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," until the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Friend or Foe"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cast Suspicion"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever an ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," is missed by a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"},", you can (as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", once per turn) designate one enemy adjacent to that ally. Compare the attack roll of the missed attack to the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"}," of that enemy; if the attack would hit, the attack targets that enemy and is resolved as normal.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"table","children":["\n\n",{"tag":"tbody","children":[{"tag":"tr","children":["\n",{"tag":"td","children":[{"tag":"i","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["This section was titled Seize the Moment in its official source, but has been renamed to distinguish it from the similarly named \"",{"tag":"a","children":["Seize the Moment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Seize_the_Moment"},".\""]}]},"\n"]}]}]}]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Seize a Moment"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Distress to Discord"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Once per turn as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},", when an enemy is reduced to 0 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," or is moved down the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Condition Track"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Condition_Track"}," by any means, you allow one ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," to take their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"}," immediately (as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},"). Furthermore, when your ally takes their ",{"tag":"a","children":["Second Wind"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Second_Wind"},", they regain a number of additional ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"}," equal to your Class Level.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Stolen Advantage"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisite:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cast Suspicion"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Whenever an enemy within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," uses the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Aid Another"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Aid_Another","referenceId":"reference:276932074aab1852"}," Action to grant one of its allies a bonus, you can (as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reaction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reaction"},") designate one ally within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"},". The enemy automatically fails to aid its ally, and the ally you designate gains a +2 bonus on its next attack roll made before the end of your next turn.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["True Betrayal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Prerequisites:"]}," ",{"tag":"b","children":["Cast Suspicion"]},", ",{"tag":"b","children":["Friend or Foe"]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["As a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Standard Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Standard_Action"},", make a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Persuasion"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Persuasion","referenceId":"reference:196fbdc5f1823320"}," check against the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," of one enemy within your ",{"tag":"a","children":["Line of Sight"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Line_of_Sight","referenceId":"reference:7ae5eaf79143552f"}," that can hear and understand you. If your check result equals or exceeds the target's ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},", that target immediately makes an attack (as a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Free Action"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Free_Action"},") against another target of your choice. This can be a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Melee Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Melee_Attack"}," against an adjacent target or a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Ranged Attack"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Ranged_Attack"}," against a target within the attacker's Point-Blank ",{"tag":"a","children":["Range"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Range"},". The target gains a +5 bonus to its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"}," if it is of a higher level than you. This is a Mind-Affecting effect.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
